@@ -1,10 +1,14 @@
-nak: CWD_MEMBAR_TYPE = L1_MEMBAR in Blackwell B QMDs
+nak: CWD_MEMBAR_TYPE = L1_MEMBAR in every QMD from Turing on
 
-NVIDIA's driver (libnvidia-eglcore.so 615.78.08) launches every Blackwell B (cec0) QMD with
-CWD_MEMBAR_TYPE = L1_MEMBAR (QMDV05_00 MW(625:624) = 3, in its QMD template); NAK left it L1_NONE.
+NVIDIA's driver (libnvidia-eglcore.so 615.78.08) builds every compute QMD from a per-class template
+(ELF 0xaa12a0) that sets CWD_MEMBAR_TYPE = L1_MEMBAR in all its compute-class arms, Turing to
+Blackwell B: word 11 = 0x44030000 for its V02/V03 layouts (ELF 0xaa1338), word 35 = 0x30000 for
+its V04 layouts, Hopper and Blackwell A (ELF 0xaa14c7), word 19 = 0x30000 for V05, Blackwell B
+(ELF 0xaa13d3).  NAK left it L1_NONE.  Set it in NAK's V02_02 (Turing only), V03_00, V04_00 and
+V05_00 QMDs.  That library has no Volta class; Volta keeps L1_NONE.
 
